**Problem 2.5.1.** Let $`A = k[x_1, \ldots, x_n]` and let $`I \neq A` be any ideal in $`A` containing all homogeneous polynomials of degree $`\geq N`. Show that $`A/I` is an indecomposable representation of $`A`.
